# THE LOADOUT SWEEP'S OUTPUT. Megabytes of measurement that is only true of the catalog it was
# taken against - see sweep.bat. Committing it would mean a diff of 1372 changed numbers every time
# a weapon moves, and a reader trusting a page that a later balance change had already invalidated.
# Re-run `sweep --fresh` instead; it takes about twenty minutes.
sweep/
